ghters of Zion are arrogant, and walk with outstretched necks and flirting eyes, walking to trip as they go, jingling…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Jeremiah 13:15","note":"Hear, and give ear. Don’t be proud, for Yahweh has spoken.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezekiel 16:50","note":"They were arrogant, and committed abomination before me. Therefore I took them away when I saw it.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}